OL,3,GNEWSAPolice treating petrol bomb attack
OL,4,Aas arson with intent to endanger life
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are treating a petrol bomb
OL,7,Fattack on a house in north Belfast as
OL,8,Farson with intent to endanger life.
OL,10,FThere were two people inside the York
OL,11,FPark property at the time of the
OL,12,Fattack.
OL,14,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,15,Fsaid the incident occurred at 19:55 GMT
OL,16,Fon Sunday and the living room was set
OL,17,Falight.
OL,19,FThe blaze was extinguished by the NI
OL,20,FFire and Rescue Service.
